# value of the anisotropic rows lacks its closing parenthesis: 0.0029(18
# for 0.0029(18); the value is still unambiguous and imports with its s.u.
# And a typo, 0..0042(15) in C42's row: that row's ADPs are ignored with a
# warning, C42 keeps its U_iso, and the structure still imports.
# Hand-written test fixture for Materials Workbench (mw-crystal-io); the
# layout follows COD entries 1101145, 4024410 and 1516392, no values are
# copied.
